:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We're not here for any pageantry.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Does this have anything to do with the wanted murderer?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Mommy, look! I'm on TV!
::'''March 7th:''' ...
:'''Welt:''' Let me remind you that in all likelihood, this stage and {{MC|ж=her|м=his}} identity have nothing to do with the wanted murderer.
:'''Aventurine:''' Oh no, they do, of course they do. Otherwise, why would I work so hard to gain your trust and then invite you all here?
:'''Aventurine:''' Because {{MC|ж=she|м=he}} is the only one who saw all three homicides. {{MC|ж=She|м=He}} is the key to proving that The Family's "death does not exist in dreams" promise is nothing but a sham!
:'''Himeko:''' Three homicides?
:'''Aventurine:''' That's right, madam &mdash; the third one is about to happen right now, right here in Clock Studios Theme Park...
:'''Aventurine:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|A truly grand death}}.
:'''Aventurine:''' You, you, you, and you... All of you are going to die! And it's all because of you, {{MC|м=Mr.|ж=Miss}} Stellaron...
:'''Aventurine:''' ...You will become the personification of "Death."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are you on about?
::'''Aventurine:''' I thought my intent was crystal clear...
